Welcome to LyargoOS.

Two users are available:

    - root:voidlinux
    - anon:voidlinux

The 'anon' user has passwordless sudo access.

To install LyargoOS to disk, run:

    # void-installer

LyargoOS uses xbps for package management:

    - xbps-install(1) to install/update packages
    - xbps-query(1) to query package info

Flatpak is pre-configured with Flathub:

    - flatpak install flathub <app-name>

Thanks for using LyargoOS.

